WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.100
You need a screenshot of the whole page.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.367
But your screen only shows

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.500
a slice of it.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:07.800
Meet Tall Screenshot.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.833
A free Chrome extension that captures the whole page,

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:13.167
or exactly as much as you want.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.633
Click Full page, and it scrolls for you.

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:18.600
Stop whenever you've got enough.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.400
Every screen is stitched together, pixel for pixel.

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:25.733
Or drag to select an area.

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:28.167
Keep dragging past the bottom of the screen,

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.900
and the page keeps scrolling,

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.867
so your selection can be as tall as you like.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.700
It all opens in a built-in editor.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.567
Crop it, copy it,

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:42.167
or download it as a PNG, a JPG, or WebP.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.267
Need a color?

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.600
The picker magnifies every pixel,

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.567
and copies its hex code with one click.

00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:52.700
And the ruler measures anything:

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.300
the space between edges,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.367
boxes that snap to the content,

00:00:56.367 --> 00:00:59.133
and the exact size of any element.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.100
Sticky headers show up once,

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.700
not on every screen.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.933
Lazy images load first.

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:07.300
And apps that scroll inside

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.100
a panel work too.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:12.133
Everything happens on your own computer.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:14.133
No account, no uploads,

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.967
and it only sees the tab you use it on.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.167
Tall Screenshot is free.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:23.933
Get it at nomanshafiq.com/tall-screenshot
